{"seq":2,"slug":"investment-appraisal-criteria","title":"大学工程管理 — 投资评价指标（NPV / IRR / 回收期）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/investment-appraisal-criteria","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学工程管理-投资评价指标-npv-irr-回收期\">大学工程管理 — 投资评价指标（NPV / IRR / 回收期）</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>上一节我们学会了把任意时点的钱折算到今天。本节就用这把钥匙，回答工程投资中最关键的问题：<strong>这个项目到底值不值得做？</strong> 工程经济学提供了三个核心判据，各有侧重——<strong>净现值（NPV）</strong> 衡量项目能创造多少&quot;今天的净财富&quot;，是最严谨的指标；<strong>内部收益率（IRR）</strong> 告诉你项目的&quot;年化回报率&quot;有多高，便于和利率门槛比较；<strong>投资回收期</strong> 则简单粗暴地告诉你&quot;多久能把本钱赚回来&quot;，反映资金安全性。</p>\n<p>理解这三者的逻辑、算法和适用边界，是工程投资决策的基本功。现实中它们常常一起用、互相印证——NPV 看价值、IRR 看回报率、回收期看风险，三者拼出一个项目完整的&quot;经济画像&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"净现值-npv-最可靠的金标准\">净现值 NPV：最可靠的金标准</h3><p>净现值就是把项目各年的现金流（含初期投资）全部折现到第 0 年后求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV = \\sum_{t=0}^{n} \\frac{CF_t}{(1+i)^t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年的净现金流（流入为正、流出为负），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 是折现率。<strong>判据</strong>很简单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>：项目能创造正的净财富，<strong>可行</strong>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>：项目会毁灭价值，<strong>应拒绝</strong>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>：恰好达到要求回报率，可做可不做。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>完整算例</strong>：某设备投资项目，第 0 年投入 100 万，之后 4 年每年末净收益 30 万，折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>年份 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>现金流 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>折现系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.08</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1.08)^{-t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0436em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1.08</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>现值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-100</td>\n<td>1.000</td>\n<td>-100.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>+30</td>\n<td>0.926</td>\n<td>+27.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>+30</td>\n<td>0.857</td>\n<td>+25.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>+30</td>\n<td>0.794</td>\n<td>+23.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>+30</td>\n<td>0.735</td>\n<td>+22.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合计</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td><strong>-0.6</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>27.8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25.7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>23.8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>22.1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> 万元</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV \\approx 27.8 + 25.7 + 23.8 + 22.1 - 100 = -0.6\\ 万元</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万元</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>结论：NPV 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，<strong>略小于零</strong>，意味着在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 的折现率下这个项目几乎不赚钱、甚至略亏。如果不折现，&quot;投 100 收 120&quot;看似赚 20 万；一旦考虑时间价值，结论就反转了——这正是工程经济学的价值所在。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内部收益率-irr-项目自己的-回报率\">内部收益率 IRR：项目自己的&quot;回报率&quot;</h3><p>IRR 是使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的那个折现率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{t=0}^{n} \\frac{CF_t}{(1+IRR)^t} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的含义是&quot;项目能自我消化的最高资金成本&quot;。<strong>判据</strong>：把 IRR 与企业要求的最低收益率（基准折现率/MARR）比较——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>基准</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IRR &gt; 基准</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基准</span></span></span></span></span> 则可行。上例中由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 时已接近 0，可推断其 IRR 略低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.7%</span></span></span></span></span>）；若企业要求回报率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>，则该项目不达标。</p>\n<p>IRR 的优点是直观（一个百分数，老板一听就懂），缺点也明显：当现金流出现多次正负交替时，IRR 可能<strong>有多个解或无解</strong>；比较互斥方案时，IRR 还可能与 NPV 给出矛盾的排序。因此学术界公认 <strong>NPV 比 IRR 更可靠</strong>，IRR 适合作辅助沟通工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"投资回收期-简单但有盲区\">投资回收期：简单但有盲区</h3><p>回收期是&quot;累计净现金流回正&quot;所需的时间。仍用上例（不折现的静态回收期）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>累计：第</mtext><mn>1</mn><mtext>年</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>70</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 第</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext>年</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 第</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext>年</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 第</mtext><mn>4</mn><mtext>年</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">累计：第1年 -70,\\ 第2年 -40,\\ 第3年 -10,\\ 第4年 +20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">累计：第</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第 3 年末还差 10 万，第 4 年收 30 万，故回收期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 3 + \\frac{10}{30} \\approx 3.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.33</span></span></span></span></span> 年。</p>\n<p>回收期越短，资金回笼越快、风险越低，因此偏好流动性的企业很看重它。但它有两个致命盲区：<strong>忽略了时间价值</strong>（静态回收期）和<strong>忽略了回收期之后的现金流</strong>（一个回收期短但后续没收益的项目，可能远不如回收期长但长期盈利的项目）。所以回收期只能当&quot;风险筛子&quot;，不能当唯一决策依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三大指标对比\">三大指标对比</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[投资评价] --&gt; B[NPV&lt;br/&gt;看创造多少净财富]&#10;    A --&gt; C[IRR&lt;br/&gt;看年化回报率]&#10;    A --&gt; D[回收期&lt;br/&gt;看资金多快回笼]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[最严谨, 推荐为主]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[直观, 注意多解陷阱]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[简单, 忽略时间价值与后期收益]\">graph TD\n    A[投资评价] --&gt; B[NPV&lt;br/&gt;看创造多少净财富]\n    A --&gt; C[IRR&lt;br/&gt;看年化回报率]\n    A --&gt; D[回收期&lt;br/&gt;看资金多快回笼]\n    B --&gt; B1[最严谨, 推荐为主]\n    C --&gt; C1[直观, 注意多解陷阱]\n    D --&gt; D1[简单, 忽略时间价值与后期收益]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>衡量什么</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NPV</td>\n<td>净财富增量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 可行</td>\n<td>需先定折现率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IRR</td>\n<td>年化回报率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 基准可行</td>\n<td>可能多解、排序矛盾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回收期</td>\n<td>回本速度</td>\n<td>越短越好</td>\n<td>忽略时间价值与后期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实务中的标准做法是：<strong>以 NPV 为主，IRR 辅助沟通，回收期把控风险</strong>，三者交叉验证才能做出稳健的投资决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某项目第 0 年投 200 万，之后 5 年每年收 55 万，折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7%</span></span></span></span></span>。计算 NPV，判断是否可行。</li>\n<li>为什么说&quot;不考虑时间价值时项目赚钱、考虑后却亏钱&quot;？请用上例数据解释这一反转。</li>\n<li>IRR 与 NPV 在评价单个项目时结论一致，但在比较互斥方案时可能矛盾。你认为应以哪个为准？为什么？</li>\n<li>静态回收期忽略了时间价值，&quot;动态回收期&quot;如何修正这一点？它又仍然忽略了什么？</li>\n<li>一个&quot;回收期 2 年但之后毫无收益&quot;的项目，和一个&quot;回收期 5 年但能持续盈利 20 年&quot;的项目，只看回收期会做出什么错误判断？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《工程经济学》——NPV/IRR 章节及标准系数表</li>\n<li>Brealey &amp; Myers,《公司理财》——NPV 与 IRR 的深入对比与陷阱分析</li>\n<li>Excel 的 NPV()、IRR() 函数——动手用电子表格复算本节例题</li>\n<li>案例：任何上市公司年报中的&quot;在建工程&quot;与可行性研究报告</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>NPV 把全部现金流折现求和，大于零则项目创造净财富，是最严谨可靠的判据；IRR 是令 NPV 为零的折现率，直观反映回报率但有多解和排序矛盾的陷阱；回收期衡量回本速度、简单但忽略时间价值与后期收益。三者各有侧重，实务中以 NPV 为主、IRR 辅助、回收期控风险，交叉验证。本节例题揭示了一个深刻教训：不折现的&quot;账面盈利&quot;可能在考虑时间价值后反转为亏损。下一节我们将处理更复杂的情形——多个方案如何公平比选，以及如何应对未来的不确定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学工程管理 — 投资评价指标（NPV / IRR / 回收期）","id":"大学工程管理-投资评价指标-npv-irr-回收期"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"净现值 NPV：最可靠的金标准","id":"净现值-npv-最可靠的金标准"},{"level":3,"text":"内部收益率 IRR：项目自己的\"回报率\"","id":"内部收益率-irr-项目自己的-回报率"},{"level":3,"text":"投资回收期：简单但有盲区","id":"投资回收期-简单但有盲区"},{"level":3,"text":"三大指标对比","id":"三大指标对比"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学工程管理 — 货币的时间价值","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/time-value-of-money"},"next":{"title":"大学工程管理 — 多方案比选与敏感性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/alternatives-comparison"}}